---
title: Academic Evaluation Portal — System Flowchart
---
flowchart TD
    Start([User opens portal]) --> Landing{Choose entry}

    Landing -->|Browse without login| Guest[Guest Panel]
    Landing -->|Sign in| Login[Login page]

    Guest --> G1[Select program / curriculum]
    G1 --> G2[Simulate student evaluation]
    G2 --> G3[View standing, lacking units, subject status]
    G3 --> EndGuest([End])

    Login --> Auth{Valid credentials?}
    Auth -->|No| LoginFail[Show error]
    LoginFail --> Login
    Auth -->|Yes| ForcePwd{Must change password?}
    ForcePwd -->|Yes| ChangePwd[Force password change]
    ChangePwd --> RouteRole
    ForcePwd -->|No| RouteRole{User role}

    RouteRole -->|Admin| Admin[Admin Panel]
    RouteRole -->|Dean| Dean[Dean Panel]
    RouteRole -->|Program Head| PH[Program Head Panel]
    RouteRole -->|Secretary| Sec[Secretary Panel]
    RouteRole -->|Faculty / Evaluator| Fac[Faculty Panel]
    RouteRole -->|Student| Stu[Student Panel]

    subgraph AdminShell["Admin shell modules (permission-based)"]
        direction TB
        M1[Lookup Data]
        M2[User Management]
        M3[Student Management]
        M4[Curriculum Management]
        M5[Elective Slots]
        M6[Student Information]
        M7[Security & Audit Logs]
        M8[CSV Import]
    end

    Admin --> AdminShell
    Dean --> AdminShell
    PH --> AdminShell
    Sec --> AdminShell

    subgraph EvalFlow["Curriculum evaluation"]
        direction TB
        E1[Search / filter students]
        E2[Open student evaluation view]
        E3[Review curriculum rows & grades]
        E4[Update evaluation status]
        E5[Save / approve evaluation]
        E1 --> E2 --> E3 --> E4 --> E5
    end

    Dean --> EvalFlow
    Fac --> EvalFlow
    PH --> EvalFlow

    Fac --> FDash[Dashboard & Analytics]
    Dean --> DDash[Dashboard & Analytics]

    Stu --> S1[View profile]
    S1 --> S2[View curriculum progress & grades]

    M8 --> CSVStart[Upload SIS Grade Deliberation file]
    CSVStart --> Preview[Preview all rows]
    Preview --> RowCheck{Each row valid?}

    RowCheck -->|Student / term error| Block1[Cannot import — fix file or term IDs]
    RowCheck -->|Subject code not in system| Block2[Cannot import — code mismatch]
    RowCheck -->|All checks pass| Ready[Row: Ready]

    Block2 --> FixUI[Fix subject — map import code to system code]
    FixUI --> Bulk{Apply to all rows<br/>with same import code?}
    Bulk -->|Yes| MapAll[Example: ITE 308 → ITE 360 for all rows]
    Bulk -->|No| MapOne[Map one row only]
    MapAll --> Fixed[Row: Fixed / Ready]
    MapOne --> Fixed

    Ready --> AllReady{All rows ready?}
    Fixed --> AllReady
    Block1 --> AllReady

    AllReady -->|No| Preview
    AllReady -->|Yes| ImportBtn[Import records]
    ImportBtn --> SaveDB[(Save to tbl_evaluation<br/>+ student profiles)]
    SaveDB --> Done([Import complete])

    AdminShell --> Logout[Logout]
    EvalFlow --> Logout
    Stu --> Logout
    Logout --> Start
